      "message": "perf(vapor): add fast path for static class names (#14803)\n\nSpecialize simple class object and empty-string ternary bindings into flag-based setClassName calls, avoiding normalizeClass on the pure Vapor class hot path while preserving static class ordering and falling back for unsafe shapes.\n\nBrowser bench shows ~2.6x faster stable single-key ternary updates, ~9-21x faster stable single-key object updates depending on static base classes, ~30-37x faster stable multi-key object updates, and ~5-8x faster sparse multi-key churn.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "44415d4459cc0db0a8e365a28f1fd864d76eb395",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/git/trees/44415d4459cc0db0a8e365a28f1fd864d76eb395"
      },
